  connector 'SAMEfficiencyProjector Storage' is from outlet ApparelContext.SAMEfficiencyProjector.SAMEfficiencyProjectorToRepository to inlet ApparelContext.CutOrderRepository.CutOrderRepositoryFromSAMEfficiencyProjector with {
